<title>USA: TABLE-Carbo Ceramics Q2 net income rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Carbo Ceramics Q2 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>CARBO CERAMICS INC</p>
<p>			3 Mos ended 6/30	    6 Mos ended 6/30</p>
<p>			   1997	 1996	  1997	  1996</p>
<p> Revenues     $20,892,548 $17,399,464 $38,733,156 $30,432,403</p>
<p>Income before taxes (a)</p>
<p>		    8,519,456   5,024,657  15,689,531   9,399,741</p>
<p> Net income     5,448,511   4,021,367  10,034,779   8,396,451</p>
<p> Pro forma net(b) 5,448,511 3,115,287  10,034,779   5,827,839</p>
<p>Net EPS (pro forma 1996)</p>
<p>			   0.37	  0.21	  0.67	  0.40</p>
<p>Avg shrs (pro forma 1996)</p>
<p>		   14,865,303  14,729,863  14,865,303  14,665,932</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) 1996 JQ2 income before taxes includes $1.1 million charge relating to recognition of additional compensation expense for issuing restricted stock in IPO.</p>
<p>(b)  Pro forma net income based on effective tax rate of 38%.  Prior to April 24, 1996, company was had S corp status.</p>
</text>
